      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "A denied roof insurance claim is not final; you can reverse it by reading the official denial letter, getting an independent professional inspection, and requesting a re-inspection.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "reading the official denial letter, getting an independent professional inspection, and requesting a re-inspection"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Steps to Take After a Denial"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Read the Denial Letter: Find the exact reason for the rejection, such as wear-and-tear, pre-existing damage, or lack of evidence, and check for any appeal deadlines."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Get an Independent Inspection: Hire a reputable, licensed local roofing contractor to inspect your roof, take high-resolution photos, and write a detailed damage report."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Collect Weather Data: Gather official local weather reports or storm data for the exact date of the loss to prove a qualifying event occurred."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Request a Re-Inspection: Submit your contractor\u2019s report and weather evidence to your insurer, and ask to have your contractor present on the roof while the insurance adjuster re-inspects the damage."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Hire a Public Adjuster: If the insurer still refuses to pay, consider hiring a public adjuster or invoking the appraisal clause in your policy to independently negotiate your claim."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, tell me:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What reason was listed in your denial letter?"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "When did the storm or damage event happen?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can give you more specific advice on how to build your appeal."
      }
    ],
